		(uuid "487c5304-2a80-409e-a542-68a67ade1b21")
	)
	(text "1. 5.2V and 12V nets should be\n	the pre sense versions right?\n	Since they're coming from power slab\n\n2. Label CS signal CS_Pi, since it serves\n	as the backup in case CAN fails\n\n- Nick"
